c700d156-5f7c-4074-89ed-0e086a0e9558	Barbell wide bench press	Free Weights	strength	weight_reps	intermediate	68ed06e5-fd1e-4198-8eea-6b4b13e3ede2	1. Lie flat on a bench with your feet firmly planted on the floor. Hold a barbell with an overhand grip (palms facing forward), hands placed wider than shoulder-width apart. Position the barbell directly above your chest with your arms fully extended.\r\n2. Slowly lower the barbell to your chest by bending your elbows, keeping them at a 45-degree angle to your body.\r\n3. Once the barbell lightly touches your chest, push the barbell back up to the starting position by extending your arms fully.\r\n4.  Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.	1. Keep your chest up and shoulders retracted throughout the movement to maximize chest engagement.\r\n2. Breathe steadily, exhaling as you press the barbell up and inhaling as you lower it back down.\r\n3. Keep your feet firmly planted on the floor for stability and support.\r\n	{"video_url": "videos/Chest/Barbell Wide Bench Press.mp4", "image_male_end": "images/Chest/Barbell Wide Bench Press1.jpg", "image_male_start": "images/Chest/Barbell Wide Bench Press.jpg"}	500	t	exercise_animatic	2026-08-07 07:44:48.007085+00	2026-08-07 07:44:48.007085+00
