7c18b6e7-34d0-4339-8826-ea214c846dfe	Cable Upper Chest Crossover	Resistance	strength	weight_reps	intermediate	7c8ccea6-1ecd-4abd-a28f-2f05d0d539a5	1. Stand in the center of a cable crossover machine with the pulleys set at the lowest point. Grasp the handles with each hand, palms facing forward.\r\n2. Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart and knees slightly bent. \r\n3. Pull the handles up and forward until they meet over your chest.\r\n4. Slowly return your arms to the starting position. Repeat for the desired repetitions.	1. Exhale as you pull the handles down and infront of your chest and inhale as you return them to the starting position.\r\n2. Use a lighter weight to ensure proper form and gradually increase the resistance as you get stronger.\r\n3. Focus on engaging your chest muscles during the movement.	{"video_url": "videos/Chest/Cable Upper Chest Crossover.mp4", "image_male_end": "images/Chest/Cable Upper Chest Crossover1.jpg", "image_male_start": "images/Chest/Cable Upper Chest Crossover.jpg"}	500	t	exercise_animatic	2026-08-07 07:44:48.007085+00	2026-08-07 07:44:48.007085+00
