5786ddcd-ec2f-4ec3-834e-835609af747f	Resistance Band Squat	Resistance	strength	weight_reps	intermediate	0496ab82-eab1-4362-8dca-c3f5cd24f67f	1. Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart and place a loop resistance band around your thighs, just above your knees. Keep your chest up and bring both hands close to your chest.\r\n2. Lower your body into a squat position by bending your knees and pushing your hips back as if you are sitting in a chair.\r\n3. Push through your heels to stand back up to the starting position, keeping the resistance band taut.\r\n4. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.	1. Keep your chest up and lean slightly forward to maintain proper form.\r\n2. Ensure your knees stay in line with your toes and do not collapse inward.\r\n3. Exhale as you stand up and inhale as you lower into the squat.	{"video_url": "videos/Legs/Resistance Band Squat.mp4", "image_male_end": "images/Legs/Resistance Band Squat1.jpg", "image_female_end": "images/Legs/Resistance Band Squat_Female1.jpg", "image_male_start": "images/Legs/Resistance Band Squat.jpg", "image_female_start": "images/Legs/Resistance Band Squat_Female.jpg"}	500	t	exercise_animatic	2026-08-07 07:44:48.007085+00	2026-08-07 07:44:48.007085+00
