faf775f6-55d8-4baf-8545-8e04138fcc69	Zotman curl dumbbell simultaneous	Free Weights	strength	weight_reps	intermediate	bfdb4696-9395-413b-bf0f-675c7a90d3be	1. Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart, holding a dumbbell in each hand with an underhand grip (palms facing forward) and arms hanging by your sides.\r\n2. Curl the dumbbells towards your shoulders by bending your elbows and keeping your upper arms stationary.\r\n3. At the top of the curl, rotate your wrists so that your palms face forward (overhand grip), and then lower the dumbbells back down to the starting position with control.\r\n4. Rotate your wrists back to the underhand grip once you reach the bottom of the movement. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.	1. Avoid using momentum; focus on using your biceps and forearms to lift and lower the dumbbells.\r\n2. Keep your core engaged to maintain balance and stability.\r\n3. Ensure a smooth and controlled rotation of the wrists at the top of the movement.	{}	500	t	exercise_animatic	2026-08-07 07:44:48.007085+00	2026-08-07 07:44:48.007085+00
